 "notes": "Kept Radio, Clock radio and Radio scanner; added Shortwave and world-band receiver. Radio: Philips/Roberts models kept (Revival Uno models became versions of the Roberts Revival archetype). Radio scanner trimmed from 11 Uniden models to 8 plus Whistler WS1010 (Reviewed pick); dropped BCD536HP, BCD996P2, SR30C as near-duplicates. Braun SK 4 is a radio-phonograph and belongs on the radiogram shelf, not here. Not attested on a retrieved page and left out: Sony ICF-2001D aside, Eton models, AOR scanners, Whistler beyond WS1010, Grundig Satellit 2000/3400 (only listings), Tecsun model years. Regency TR-1 and Sony TR-55 both sourced from the TR-1 article."
